{
  "about": "This file has two lists. 'sources' are the third-party files the build needs. fetch/fetch_all.py downloads each one, checks its sha256 and copies it into a folder that git ignores. 'content' has one entry for each folder of the reference library (2026-11-08, about 1.2 TB), with the script that fetches it, its license and its status. Content has no checksums, because Kiwix, archive.org and the mirrored websites change their files over time. The pins were last checked on 2026-11-10. Nobody has checked the license lines marked 'verify' against the source's own terms. Read them before you give away or sell a box, and see library/LICENSES.md for the obligations.",
